  "sourceTitle": "Steak In Mushroom Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Steak In Mushroom Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Monday, November 30, 2009 - 11:57pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound round steak\nCooking sherry\nCream of mushroom soup\n4 ounces sour cream\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cut steak in strips. Brown in butter. Add 4 tablespoons cooking sherry. Simmer 10 minutes. Add soup and simmer on low 2 minutes. Before serving add sour cream. Serve over rice or noodles.",
